"Shape correction (commit 03ad991): user wanted the TS Record passed to the server directly. VERIFIED IMPOSSIBLE on SpacetimeDB 2.1: SATS AlgebraicType has no map type (Product/Sum/Array/String/primitives only), and codegen also rejects generic Named<T> ('name Named is used for multiple types'). Landed the user's stated fallback literally: per-kind Named*Author pair structs { name, value } (secador-stamped), AssetPack fields are Vec<Named*Author>, and the client has exactly ONE generic adapter namedPairs(record, toValue) mapping Record entries to pairs -- names verbatim from Record keys; per-kind converters reshape only bodies (authoring sugar like type tags/hotkey chars -> wire shape) and never see names. If a future SpacetimeDB version adds a map type or generic monomorphization, Vec<NamedX> collapses back to the Record/generic form. Verified: full gate green (cargo test, clippy, web check, 101 unit, e2e 0-5)."